2000 ROMSIZE
00 0BF RAMRANGE

0D0 EQUATE LCDCON  0D1 EQUATE LCDVOL 0D2 EQUATE P0PUR   0D3 EQUATE P1PUR  
0D4 EQUATE CLKCON  0D5 EQUATE FLAGS  0D6 EQUATE OSCCON  0D7 EQUATE STPCON
0D8 EQUATE VLDCON  0D9 EQUATE SP     
0DC EQUATE BTCON   0DD EQUATE BTCNT  0DF EQUATE SYM
0E0 EQUATE P0      0E1 EQUATE P1     0E2 EQUATE P2      0E3 EQUATE P3
0E4 EQUATE P4      0E5 EQUATE WDTCON 0E6 EQUATE P0CONH  0E7 EQUATE P0CONL
0E8 EQUATE P1CONH  0E9 EQUATE P1CONL 0EA EQUATE P2CONH  0EB EQUATE P2CONL
0EC EQUATE P3CONH  0ED EQUATE P3CONL 0EE EQUATE P3INT   0EF EQUATE P3PND  
0F0 EQUATE P4CONH  0F1 EQUATE P4CONL 0F2 EQUATE TINTPND 0F3 EQUATE TACON
0F4 EQUATE TACNT   0F5 EQUATE TADATA 0F6 EQUATE TBDATAH 0F7 EQUATE TBDATAL
0F8 EQUATE TBCON   0F9 EQUATE WTCON  0FA EQUATE ADDATAH 0FB EQUATE ADDATAL
0FC EQUATE ADCON   0FD EQUATE UARTCON 0FE EQUATE UARTPND 0FF EQUATE UDATA

END-EQUATES \ 45 EQUATES
